# API runner — environment values for the local Playwright API runner.
#
# Copy this file and fill in the values:
#     cp playwright/api/.env.example playwright/api/.env
#
# Every name below is declared by a getter in the matching module under
# playwright/api/config/. Each getter validates on access, so a missing value
# throws by name rather than silently reading as undefined.
#
# Names only — never commit a value here. playwright/api/.env is gitignored.
#
# Maintained by Stage 05 at promotion time, not by Stage 04. Names are added
# when a service module is promoted; nothing is reordered or removed.

# ── Order Service ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Source: playwright/api/config/env.order-service.ts
ORDER_SERVICE_BASE_URL=
ORDER_SERVICE_API_KEY=
ORDER_SERVICE_TEST_ORDER_ID=
ORDER_SERVICE_CATALOG_ID=

# ── Shared across services ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Source: playwright/api/config/env.shared.ts
# Intentionally empty. A variable moves here only once a second service actually
# reads it; today every variable has exactly one reader.
